{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c3297ec-db0e-11ef-bd1a-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c3297da-db0e-11ef-9f06-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"順陽","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"順陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"顺阳县","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"941d19b6-db0e-11ef-840d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南阳郡","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"941d19b7-db0e-11ef-a1b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"順水","place_name_jianti_auto":"顺水","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"941d19b8-db0e-11ef-944d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蔡","place_name_jianti_auto":"蔡","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"941d19b9-db0e-11ef-8cf9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"順陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"顺阳","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"941d19ba-db0e-11ef-96b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄧州","place_name_jianti_auto":"邓州","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"941d19bb-db0e-11ef-af70-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"穰縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"穰县","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"941d19bc-db0e-11ef-8b69-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"941d19bd-db0e-11ef-8228-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"郇邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"郇邑","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"941d19be-db0e-11ef-8662-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"郡國志，順陽縣屬南陽郡。順水東南入蔡。括地志：順陽故城，在鄧州穰縣西三十里，楚之郇邑也。復，扶又翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郡国志，顺阳县属南阳郡。顺水东南入蔡。括地志：顺阳故城，在邓州穰县西三十里，楚之郇邑也。复，扶又翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"941d19b5-db0e-11ef-beb2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"順陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"顺阳","resolved_place_entity_id":1606,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"941d19c2-db0e-11ef-a6f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"章帝封马廖为侯邑。建安中，置南乡郡。晋改为顺阳郡，而顺阳...","context_before":"...帝初封孔光为博山侯，因置博山县，属南阳郡。后汉复曰顺阳。","source_end_index":72,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b5cdb189-9f8b-5223-890f-6f87e80a93ba","source_start_index":50,"source_text":"建武四年，延岑复寇顺阳，为邓禹所败，走汉中。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3延岑復寇順陽；遣鄧禹將兵擊破之。岑奔漢中；公孫述以岑爲大司馬，封汝寧王。","content_fanyi":"延岑又侵犯顺阳县；光武帝派遣邓禹率军击败了延岑。延岑逃奔汉中郡；公孙述任命延岑为大司马，封他为汝宁王。","content_jianti_auto":"3延岑复寇顺阳；遣邓禹将兵击破之。岑奔汉中；公孙述以岑为大司马，封汝宁王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3146,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十一 (漢紀三十三) / 世祖光武皇帝上之下 / 四年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"941d19b4-db0e-11ef-808b-a0d3651f611f","year_int":28},"tongjian_id":"941d19b4-db0e-11ef-808b-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"順陽","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"明帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"明帝","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9e549e78-db0e-11ef-9e95-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"順陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"顺阳县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9e549e79-db0e-11ef-9386-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"前漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"前汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9e549e7a-db0e-11ef-ba17-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"博山","place_name_jianti_auto":"博山","start_inde